# Local development files
.air
.env
!.env.development
# Image build context: the baked Hermes ~/.hermes skeleton ships an .env
# (comments only, no secrets) that the shim exposes as an editable config
# file. Without this negation it is absent from a clean checkout and the
# claworc/hermes build fails on COPY skeleton/.
!agent/hermes/skeleton/.env
data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
ssh_key*
kube.txt
/.claude/agent-memory-local

tmp
*.log
.wrangler
.data

